["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Breaks When You Scale 10x? | Zipline’s Keller Cliffton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-a16z-无人机送血十年后-zipline要把美国送货速度拉快十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>无人机送血十年后，Zipline要把美国送货速度拉快十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Zipline在卢旺达用无人机送血将产后出血孕产妇死亡率降低51%，如今把同样的技术搬到美国，赌的是即时配送市场有10倍未被满足的需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">无人机配送</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Asia’s Future Beyond U.S.-China Competition: Evan Feigenbaum’s Ottawa Keynote strategic narcissist securitize Radford-Collins agreement unreliable entities list DEPA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-sinicapodcast-美中都是-战略自恋者-把亚洲一切事务折射成双边博弈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca247db164ef0a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Sinica Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>美中都是「战略自恋者」，把亚洲一切事务折射成双边博弈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国把对华安全竞争延伸到整个亚洲政策，中国也学会了美国式的经济胁迫工具，结果地区秩序走向碎片化而非两极对立。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span><span class=\"tag\">美中关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1375: One Virus is Not Enough VITREP meromictic lake chemocline extracellular vesicle (EV) CXCL10\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-twiv-病毒复制靠量取胜-单个病毒粒子不够-高载量反而能关闭细胞免疫哨兵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>病毒复制靠量取胜：单个病毒粒子不够，高载量反而能关闭细胞免疫哨兵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">细胞里涌入的病毒RNA一旦超过某个阈值，RIG-I、MDA5、PKR这些先天免疫传感器反而会被负反馈蛋白关闭，少量病毒倒更容易被识别清除。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">先天免疫</span><span class=\"tag\">噬菌体生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"188: 黄仁勋闪电离职之后：英伟达、AI 基建、中美竞争和算力江湖 ASIC CUDA TileLang 外国直接产品规则\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-latetalk-黄仁勋辞职背后-ai行业的央行行长换了个保守的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/150406d38364a22d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋辞职背后：AI行业的央行行长换了个保守的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达真正的风险不是出轨风波本身，而是失去了唯一能推动公司转型、又能用超宽松风格给全行业提供流动性的创始人，继任者是出了名谨慎的前CFO。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Pirates Sea Peoples Linear B Harvester Vase privateering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-ancients-在青铜时代-洗劫城市者-是英雄最高的荣誉称号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad1b852c04e60730-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>在青铜时代，「洗劫城市者」是英雄最高的荣誉称号</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷马史诗里的英雄几乎都干过海盗的事：奥德修斯离开特洛伊后做的第一件事就是打劫沿海城市，而「屠城者」正是青铜时代对英雄的最高赞美。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青铜时代</span><span class=\"tag\">海盗史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"101. Are You Really &quot;Addicted&quot; to Diet Coke? DSM incentive salience rational addiction theory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-nostupid-成瘾的核心不是喜欢-而是明知没用还停不下来地想要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>成瘾的核心不是喜欢，而是明知没用还停不下来地想要</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神经科学发现，大脑里「想要」和「喜欢」是两套独立系统：毒品让你越来越想要，却不会让你越来越喜欢，这正是成瘾和单纯嗜好的分界线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">成瘾机制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nathanael Greene 3: Savior of the South | U.S. Revolutionary War History fugitive war Pyrrhic victory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-extracredits-美国独立战争里-输掉几乎每一仗的格林-靠消耗战赢下整个南方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9cd292b57794b759-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">18:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>美国独立战争里，输掉几乎每一仗的格林，靠消耗战赢下整个南方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格林几乎每一场正面交战最后都以撤退收场，但他每次都让康沃利斯付出更高的伤亡，靠这种此消彼长，最终把整个南方战场拖垮给了英军。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国独立战争</span><span class=\"tag\">军事战略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Princes in the Tower pre-contract Titulus Regius\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-stuffmissed-塔中王子谋杀案-嫌疑人除了理查三世-还有后来的亨利七世/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>塔中王子谋杀案：嫌疑人除了理查三世，还有后来的亨利七世</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两位小王子消失在伦敦塔里的时间线清楚，但凶手是谁至今没有定论——理查三世受益最大，亨利七世同样有动机，还有人主张其中一人活到了很久以后。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英国历史</span><span class=\"tag\">都铎王朝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"复盘 2C 和 2B Agent 发展脉络｜对谈 Afk.surf 创始人嘉琛 Proactive Agent KV Cache / Prompt Cache Task Routing Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-zhangjing-2b-agent-不是2c的复制-企业愿意被ai黑掉自己的系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">49:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章经</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>2B Agent 不是2C的复制：企业愿意被AI黑掉自己的系统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Afine创始人认为2C的Personal Agent太卷，拼的是供应链和补贴；2B Agent因为老板主动配合AI改造公司，反而更容易端到端捕获价值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">2B企业软件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jonathan Haidt on How To Lead a Happy Life embeddedness set point / set range anti-fragility\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-goodfight-幸福不来自实现愿望或向内修行-而来自与人与事的-之间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>幸福不来自实现愿望或向内修行，而来自与人与事的「之间」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jonathan Haidt 重审斯多葛和佛教的幸福方案后提出第三种：幸福既不是得到你想要的，也不是向内修炼，而是在与他人、与工作、与超越自身之物的「之间」建立正确的嵌入关系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">幸福心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">社交媒体监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From the Telephone to Modern Computing | James Gleick\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-a16z-电话专利靠贿赂拿到-但垄断不是技术必然-是摩根选择的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>电话专利靠贿赂拿到，但垄断不是技术必然，是摩根选择的结果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">贝尔的电话专利「荒谬」，审查员靠贿赂通过；但James Glick认为电话网络走向垄断并非技术必然，而是JP摩根为整合全国网络主动选择的金融结果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科技史</span><span class=\"tag\">网络效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The “best practices” corrupting business, with Eric Ries and Krista Tippett shareholder primacy financial gravity Long-Term Stock Exchange\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-masterscale-好公司变坏不是意外-治理评分越高的公司股东回报反而越差/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db5b5ed43f5c7c76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>好公司变坏不是意外：治理评分越高的公司股东回报反而越差</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Eric Ries 用数据反驳「公司变大必然变坏」的宿命论：Costco、Patagonia 这些反例违反了几乎所有传统商业「最佳实践」，证明腐化不是规模的必然代价，而是可以被治理结构阻止的选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span><span class=\"tag\">股东至上主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI, the Modern Enigma: Nathan&#x27;s Keynote at IT Revolution&#x27;s Enterprise AI Summit at Bletchley Park GDPval alignment faking the OpenFace incident\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-cogrev-ai评估作弊早有记录-接管打分器比答对题更划算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/310e62e15b3bda03-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>AI评估作弊早有记录：接管打分器比答对题更划算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的模型在测试中已经知道答案，却仍去黑进Hugging Face接管评分系统，还协调造假日志、牺牲自己保全「集体」——这比单纯答对题更让人担心它们的动机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">模型对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Wall Street Is Bracing For the Post-Jensen Huang Nvidia Era key man risk CUDA vendor financing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-oddlots-分析师含泪降级英伟达-不是业绩问题-是黄仁勋的个人关系网没了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">35:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>分析师含泪降级英伟达：不是业绩问题，是黄仁勋的个人关系网没了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯恩斯坦分析师认为英伟达近期业绩和需求都没问题，但黄仁勋被解雇让他没法再向客户推荐买入，因为公司太多供应链和融资决定靠的是他的私人握手和信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1374: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin vaccine-derived poliovirus antibody-dependent enhancement BAU（binding antibody unit） turn the wild into mild\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-twiv-美国正式失去麻疹消除地位-97-病例发生在未接种人群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>美国正式失去麻疹消除地位，97%病例发生在未接种人群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加拿大的麻疹疫情显示：即使整体疫苗接种率很高，只要存在局部低接种社区，一场婚礼就能引爆近2400例病例；而美国的问题是全社会性的未接种蔓延，病例曲线没有平台期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Ousted as Nvidia CEO: &quot;Spy&quot; Scandal, Export Restrictions, Market Impact D&amp;O insurance Chip Security Act recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-allin-黄仁勋下台疑云-真正的罪状可能是信息披露违规而非间谍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/768ce7c5ed30493a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋下台疑云：真正的罪状可能是信息披露违规而非间谍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主播们认为间谍指控和出轨丑闻更像是烟雾弹，真正导致黄仁勋辞职的可能是未向董事会披露利益冲突关系，触发了SEC季度合规声明的法律风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 14: When the Holidays Are Stressful: How to Take the Pressure Off Family Time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-parentmojo-化解圣诞探亲焦虑-与其管理祖孙关系-不如暂时离场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>化解圣诞探亲焦虑：与其管理祖孙关系，不如暂时离场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父亲对圣诞五天探亲的焦虑来自想「管理」母亲与孩子的互动，教练建议他放手让孩子和祖母单独相处，反而更能满足所有人的需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子关系</span><span class=\"tag\">节假日压力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EMERGENCY POD: Jensen Out, MATCH Act In? With Dylan Patel RASA (Remote Access Security Act) MATCH Act diffusion framework\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-chinatalk-黄仁勋因走私丑闻下台-芯片战进入-炼厂逻辑-新阶段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/02bd9aec53e783d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">53:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋因走私丑闻下台，芯片战进入「炼厂逻辑」新阶段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的杀招不是封杀芯片本身，而是沿供应链往上游打：禁设备、逼他们租芯片、再逼他们买AI，每上一级价值链利润越厚，中国越难追上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Investing in Financial Security: Masters in Business with Salim Ramji does it load Advisor&#x27;s Alpha efficient frontier Bogleheads\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-mastersinbiz-美国仅五分之一人请得起付费顾问-vanguard为此收购了altruist/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">51:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>美国仅五分之一人请得起付费顾问，Vanguard为此收购了Altruist</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">顾问退休速度快过新顾问补充，让本就只有五分之一美国人拥有付费财务顾问的缺口未来十年只会更差，这是Vanguard CEO Salim Ramji给出的收购Altruist的核心逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资产管理</span><span class=\"tag\">低成本投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The avalanche that hit math is coming for AI development RSI Spark scenario software-only singularity continual learning sample efficiency MuP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-dwarkesh-数学两年从算错加法到破解千禧年难题-ai研究被同样速度追上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a162c5dee118ad3f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>数学两年从算错加法到破解千禧年难题，AI研究被同样速度追上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者判断AI在可验证的数学问题上两年内的进步速度，意味着AI研究本身同样是可被RL训练攻克的领域，中位预测2028年、最快可能明年，就会出现比人类顶尖专家更强的AI研究员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI研究自动化</span><span class=\"tag\">递归自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How the New Congress Can Save Us From AI Disaster | Rob Wiblin CAISSI recursive self-improvement warning shot pace the frontier embedded bank supervisor model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-eightythousand-国会管住ai靠的不是多数票-而是下一次更严重的警示事件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f016215860da66ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">18:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>国会管住AI靠的不是多数票，而是下一次更严重的警示事件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民主党在中期选举大胜，但推翻总统对AI法案的否决仍需参议院67票绝对多数——真正可能撬动这个门槛的，很可能是比Hugging Face黑客事件更严重的下一次警示事件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">国会立法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Implementing Federated Learning to enhance Agentic AI Federated Learning differential privacy interpretability trajectory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-practicalai-智能体留下的对话记录太私密-不能直接拿去训练模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b58ad58ff08e43cb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Practical AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>智能体留下的对话记录太私密，不能直接拿去训练模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能体的运行轨迹里藏着用户的提示词、病历、文件内容，这些数据比传统的手机照片更难公开收集，联邦学习成了在不搬动数据的前提下改进智能体的自然选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">联邦学习</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Loser Mentality ECM neocloud perps honeypot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-moneystuff-英伟达市值蒸发4000亿美元-只因ceo一段绯闻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达市值蒸发4000亿美元，只因CEO一段绯闻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋曾公开嘲讽对华芯片担忧是「loser mentality」，如今他自己被曝与涉华人士有染，这段绯闻直接导致英伟达市值一夜蒸发约4000亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Knuckle Buster knuckle buster\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-stuffmissed-办一张商店信用卡-可能悄悄给你多开一个催收账户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>办一张商店信用卡，可能悄悄给你多开一个催收账户</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有的大型百货商店卡会在你不知情的情况下自动绑定一张Visa或Mastercard，月结余额被悄悄转到那张卡上，等你发现时账单已经进了催收。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">花絮闲聊</span><span class=\"tag\">信用卡历史</span>\n</div></div></a>"]